1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:03,800
"Dr. Cooper has taken
a relatively boring subject

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:07,300
"and managed to make it
completely insufferable.

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,300
(Leonard:)Plus, he looks
like a giant insect."

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,500
(Howard:)Look. Listen to this one.

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,110
"Does Einstein's theory
explain why time flies

6
00:00:16,110 --> 00:00:17,240
"when you're having fun,

7
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:19,310
"but when you're listening
to Dr. Cooper,

8
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:20,980
it falls out of the sky, dead?"

9
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:23,480
(Raj:)Ooh, somebody took pictures

10
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,350
(Raj:)and uploaded them
to their Flickr account.

11
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:27,750
(Leonard:)Wow.

12
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,490
(Leonard:)How do you get an
entire lecture hall

13
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:31,820
(Leonard:)to flip you off
at the same time?

14
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:33,460
(Howard:)Apparently, if you're Sheldon,

15
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,930
(Howard:)all you need
to do is turn your back.

16
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:38,700
(Penny:)Hey, Leonard,
is your wi-fi down?

17
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:39,660
(Penny:)I can't get on.

18
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:41,130
(Leonard:)Oh, Sheldon changed
the password.

19
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:43,370
(Leonard:)It's now
"Penny is a freeloader."

20
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:45,740
(Leonard:)No spaces.

21
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:47,770
(Penny:)Thanks.
What are you guys doing?

22
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,540
(Leonard:)Sheldon gave a lecture
at the university tonight.

23
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:50,810
(Leonard:)We're reading
the reviews.

24
00:00:50,810 --> 00:00:52,140
(Penny:)Oh. How'd he do?

25
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:54,280
(Howard:)Well, picture the Hindenburg
meets Chernobyl

26
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:56,850
meets Three Mile Island
meets Tron 2.

27
00:00:56,850 --> 00:00:59,070
(Penny:)That bad, huh?

28
00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:01,400
(Leonard:)Read this woman's tweet.

